# Graveshifter {3}{B} 2/2 changeling: "When this creature enters, you may return target creature card from your graveyard to your hand."
# Bot1's graveyard holds Memnite (killed by its own Lightning Bolt) and the Bolt: the Bolt is not a legal target (CR 115.1, it is not a
# creature card), so the Memnite is the only one and is chosen without a question, and accepting returns it. Black Lotus (BBB) and Mox Jet pay the four mana.
# The twin that declines is "graveshifter-declined-leaves-the-creature-card-in-the-graveyard".

[Bot1 Deck]
Mox Ruby
Memnite
Lightning Bolt
Black Lotus
Mox Jet
Graveshifter
Island x4
Island x13

[Bot2 Deck]
Island x20

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Mox Ruby.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Memnite.Cast
